    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "PANAM.\nwishes you a joyous holiday season...\nand takes special pride in bringing together, from all\ncomers of the globe, men of good will and of all faiths.\nBest wishes for happy holidays, and may the coming year\nbe one of peace and prosperity for all.\n1999.648.004 199.023.008",
      "CUENS\n-DE L\nINDIA",
      "Sherry\nDubonnet Campari\nManhattan\nGin Martini Vodka Martini Noilly Prat\nBloody Mary Screwdriver Whiskey Four Tom Collins Vodka Collins\nDaiquiri Scotch Bourbon\nCanadian\nGin Vodka Bacardi Rum\nPremium Beer\nChristmas Dinner\nEgg Nog\nA Display of Hors d' Oeuvre Specialties from Various Countries\nEntrees\nRoast Young Tom Turkey\nChestnut Dressing and Giblet Gravy\nBroiled Fillet Reak\nMaître d'Hotel\nButtered Garden Vegetables\n-\nGreen Salad.\nA Selection of Cheese and Fresh Fruit\nCandied Sweet Potatoes\nDesserts\n-\nPlum Pudding\nCoffee\nFruit Cake\nTea\nSelected Red \u0026 White Wines\nCharbaut Champagne Brut\nAmaretto di Saronno. Bénédictine and Brandy\nDrambuie\nBénedictine\nCrème de Menthe\nCognac VSO Cointreau"
    ],
